11. Let the applicantAbhay Narayan alias Mulayam be released on bail in the aforesaid F.I.R./Case Crime No. 0632 OF 2022, under sections 363, 366, I.P.C., during investigation changed to sectioins 363/366/376, I.P.C. and section 3/4, Protection of Children from Sexual Offences (POCSO) Act,
